# A bootable system with POS as the base of an RPM system: container-dnf's
# packages and Fedora's kernel, whose scriptlets install it with POS's
# kernel-install (root/etc/kernel): dracut makes the initramfs, the boot
# loader entry goes to /boot, which is the ESP when the system runs.
# BUILD.md "Images".
#
# One RPM package per line. A name the build made an RPM of (pos,
# pos-sdk, pos-fedora, pos-debuginfo) is installed from that file, anything
# else from Fedora's repositories.

pos
pos-sdk
pos-fedora
dnf
kernel-core
kernel-modules
dracut
